#: prompt_matrix/templates/index.html:76 prompt_matrix/templates/index.html:79
msgid "Which AI models do you want to use?"
msgstr "要用哪些 AI 模型？"

#: prompt_matrix/templates/index.html:78
msgid ""
"Pick who answers. \"Connected\" means you already have a key on this "
"machine."
msgstr "选择谁来回答。「已连接」表示这台电脑上已有该模型的密钥。"

#: prompt_matrix/templates/index.html:81
msgid "Also ask"
msgstr "也询问"

#: prompt_matrix/templates/index.html:83
msgid "Add another"
msgstr "再加一个"

#: prompt_matrix/templates/index.html:84
msgid ""
"Free uses two models when both are live (Gemini + DeepSeek). Pro unlocks "
"the rest."
msgstr "免费版在两者都在线时用两个模型（Gemini 和 DeepSeek）。Pro 解锁其余。"

#: prompt_matrix/templates/index.html:89
msgid "Run offline (local)"
msgstr "离线运行（本地）"

#: prompt_matrix/templates/index.html:93
msgid "Save tokens (cheaper)"
msgstr "节省用量（更便宜）"

#: prompt_matrix/templates/index.html:96
msgid ""
"You can also run offline with local models. Offline uses a runner on this"
" machine. Usually Ollama. vLLM, SGLang, Llamafile, or LM Studio also work"
" if they are already up."
msgstr ""
"也可以用本机模型离线运行。离线会用这台电脑上的运行器，一般是 Ollama。vLLM、SGLang、Llamafile 或 LM Studio "
"若已启动也可以。"

